            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points:
• The Attacks characteristic of its **Crushing Iron Feet** is 3.
• It has a Control characteristic of 5.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Power to Maximum!" id="11ca-9353-c188-1929" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 or more of the following effects to apply for the rest of the turn. For each effect you pick, give this unit a number of **heat tokens** equal to the number beside it.
**1 *Load Triple Shot!*:** This unit&apos;s **Breacher Cannon** has **Crit (2 Hits)**.
**1 *Go, Go, Go!*:** When making charge rolls for this unit, add 1 to the number of dice rolled, to a maximum of 3, then remove 1 dice of your choice and use the remaining dice as the charge roll.
**3 *Get Us In There!*:** This unit&apos;s **Crushing Iron Feet** have **Charge (+1 Damage)**
**3 *Load Chain Shot!*:** Each time this unit uses a **^^Shoot^^** ability, after that ability has been resolved, if any enemy models were slain by attacks made with this unit&apos;s **Breacher Cannon**, for each model slain by those attacks, inflict 1 mortal damage on that model&apos;s unit.
**4 *Disengage Safeties!*:**The Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s **Realmscorcher Flame Cannon** is 22.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Overheating" id="bc7d-b878-c601-9c35" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Immediately after resolving this unit&apos;s &apos;Full Power!&apos; ability, you must roll a number of dice equal to the number of **heat tokens** this unit has. For each 5+, allocate 1 damage point to this unit (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points), then remove 1 of this unit&apos;s **heat tokens**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
